<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Bank shall, upon receipt of an application for registration under section 25, register the applicant."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
