<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Bank proposes to deregister a registered currency processor under section 30, the Bank shall give the registered currency processor a notice setting out the proposed deregistration and the grounds for the proposed deregistration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
