<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A registered currency processor who has received a notice under subsection (1) shall be given an opportunity to make a representation to the Bank within fourteen days from the date of the notice."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
