<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_32__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where a registered currency processor voluntarily deregisters under section 29 or the Bank deregisters a registered currency processor under subsection 31(3), the registered currency processor shall immediately cease from carrying on currency processing business on the effective date of the deregistration."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
