<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_35__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_35__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The Bank may sue any person to recover any unpaid fees under this Act as a civil debt due to the Government and the court may award the cost of recovering the unpaid fees to the Bank. Preservation of secrecy"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
