<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_36__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who contravenes subsection (1) or (2) commits an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding three million ringgit or imprisonment for a term not exceeding three years or to both. Detention of currency suspected to be counterfeit"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_37> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "37" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
