<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_38__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The person from whom the currency note or currency coin is detained under section 37 shall provide the information required under subsection (1) to the Bank, registered currency processor and financial institution."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_38__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_38> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
