<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_39> <https://schema.org/text> "The Bank, registered currency processor and financial institution shall surrender any currency note or currency coin detained under section 37, and the Bank, registered currency processor and financial institution shall furnish the information recorded under subsection 38(1), to the police. Currency remains property of person from whom currency was detained if currency is genuine"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
