<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_IV__cl_40__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall be entitled to recover any compensation for any loss suffered by him due to the detention of currency note or currency coin under section 37. Submission of document or information"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
