<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@/~part_V__cl_50__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Bank proposes to take any action against a person under section 47 or 48, the Bank shall provide to the person a notice setting out the proposed action and the grounds for the proposed action."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/eng@> .
